@requires:nelim.pickletools.textureowner
Feature: every coat texture is served by this mod

  # Offline, Check-Coats.ps1 proves all 201 files exist and are all referenced. This proves the game's own content
  # holders answer for each of them and that no other running mod took the path. West is not shipped: the game
  # mirrors east. 02-textures keeps its sample for a quick read; this is the whole list.

  Scenario Outline: <path> facing <rotation> is answered by this mod
